text:
Now the oak has more followers as embers than in leaf and fruit, and cloudy Orion stains the once-purple regions with mourning;


sluggish Arcturus and the Bears give little sun, and ice with gray command fashions waters into prisons;


today, when life is sought in warmth, thanks to ruling winter, a blind lover whom Love despises and Lisi forgets,


I bring my heart to her lovely ice, to see whether her snow will delight in my fire.
